# .env.example
# Copy this to .env for local development. Never commit .env.
# Keep this file up to date — it is the team's documentation for required variables.

# The contact form submits directly to a Google Apps Script web app
# (leads -> Google Sheet + email notification). The endpoint is not a
# secret (it's a public-by-design URL), so it's hardcoded in
# src/components/sections/contact/ContactFormSection.tsx rather than
# configured via env var. See docs/leads-integration/apps-script.gs.
